{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（4日）早上9時24分，青葵公路往九龍方向、近美孚新邨對開路段發生車禍，一輛私家車因避路面帆布而收慢時，與後方一輛收制不及的警方電單車相撞。意外中，一名警員手、腳及肩頸受傷。消防處先後調派3輛救護車到場，受傷警員清醒，由救護車送往瑪嘉烈醫院接受治療。警方正在現場指揮交通及調查車禍成因。</p><figure><img alt=\"一名身穿制服的警員由救護車送往瑪嘉烈醫院接受治療。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194596697183883264763589.jpeg/g8khUMt9jnhdZZDugaeM154DYSiuakXK_7jS09q40tM\"/><figcaption>一名身穿制服的警員由救護車送往瑪嘉烈醫院接受治療。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><p>意外中，一名身穿制服的警員手、腳及肩膀受傷，需固定頭部並戴上頸箍，清醒由救護車送往瑪嘉烈醫院接受治療。多名警員到醫院了解同袍狀況。</p><figure><img alt=\"多名警員到院了解同袍狀況。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194600556232970240427163.jpeg/U3kBMsAV0lRxlD5udLTgRTmd9MMa20VmCLsyGi27Mho\"/><figcaption>多名警員到院了解同袍狀況。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涉事警方鐵馬由拖車拖走。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194605983721197568708631.jpeg/CPcqzA2xj4znopWz5EGFOekEOSMI6O883VEN8d1RDfE\"/><figcaption>涉事警方鐵馬由拖車拖走。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方檢走一個懷疑涉事帆布袋。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194605980961214464647520.jpeg/COoxW_vrXxeSu1JWzozlp9C7R09eeze7EsAhpxLAIac\"/><figcaption>警方檢走一個懷疑涉事帆布袋。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涉事鐵馬右側車身刮損。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194606746996314112873145.jpeg/vWYPlnnt7tQLYrXzF-vK3aNFeMssVczbO6md6jupneo\"/><figcaption>涉事鐵馬右側車身刮損。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涉事私家車左側車尾被撞毀。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194606749357838336695143.jpeg/7TRoY0Crr6rFMOJ0R6l8eDTm3IMhH81Ck4XFqZOFxak\"/><figcaption>涉事私家車左側車尾被撞毀。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方鐵馬由拖車拖走。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194606751618699264163954.jpeg/ONE726Npf_YXJOBzlqQm_PKXlMakSMSqWcglYFnIJWA\"/><figcaption>警方鐵馬由拖車拖走。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方鐵馬由拖車拖走。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194606753787285504761405.jpeg/W52NzHIQZ7LNmco57RZzLi9J0RyR9NchgbL1-YGy9fk\"/><figcaption>警方鐵馬由拖車拖走。</figcaption></figure><p>網上圖片可見，一名駕駛電單車的交通警員受傷倒地，多名市民上前了解其傷勢。</p><figure><img alt=\"一名交通警員倒地，多名市民上前了解其傷勢。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194590804945932288851026.jpeg/SEOmaSKViiX2fS5A0WQzgVKRx4Q8VCKLVDosTlQ6LE4\"/><figcaption>一名交通警員倒地，多名市民上前了解其傷勢。</figcaption></figure><p>運輸署早前宣布，因交通意外而一度封閉的青葵公路（往九龍方向）近荔枝角公園的部份行車線現已解封，車龍有待消散。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T03:24:56.225921+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":453,"images":9,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T02:10:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T03:18:45.477908+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T03:18:45.477908+00:00","content_hash":"559d47066d96bb9daa995e96b8fec05e6552cde6a4acab0cbc16734a9664f4fb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}